cff-version: 1.2.0
title: chembl-easy
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hentabli
    given-names: Hamza
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9530-2815
repository-code: https://github.com/hentablihamza/chembl-easy
url: https://github.com/hentablihamza/chembl-easy
abstract: >
  Search ChEMBL and download clean, ML-ready bioactivity data. A retrying,
  caching, paginating client for the ChEMBL REST API with target resolution
  (gene symbol, UniProt accession, ChEMBL ID), server-side activity filters,
  assay confidence and data-quality filtering, unit harmonization to nM and
  p-scale, per-compound aggregation with variance flags, and compound search by
  name, similarity and substructure.
keywords:
  - ChEMBL
  - cheminformatics
  - drug discovery
  - QSAR
  - bioactivity
  - RDKit
  - machine learning
